,"neuronKeys":[],"edgeStrings":["[#782a6]_#_[#26f4a]","[#782a6]_#_[#62dfa]"],"description":"Try changing what SpikerBot will seek, by changing the camera targets. If you change the camera zones, how might this change how SpikerBot perceives the color?","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775684783898","neuronKeys":[],"edgeStrings":["[#26f4a]_#_[#06f17]","[#62dfa]_#_[#9e98c]"],"description":"Try experimenting with the outputs as well! Can you make SpikerBot chase down objects faster, or slower?","thumbnail":""}],"info":{"title":"Blue is My Favorite Color","description":"SpikerBot loves the color blue, and will try to get as close as it can when it sees anything blue!","author":"User","version":"1.0.1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:46:28.006634"}}